. *   arm_c: mean = (90 + 110 + 110)/3 = 103.333, sd = (110 - 90)/1.34898 = 14.826
. * Xie 2014: sufentanil ug -> MME (factor 1.0, 1000:1)     [CORRECTED from 0.1]
. 
